    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1119">

                <pb facs="1407" n="1397" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg1397"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.52/7–2247: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-07-29T18:00:00-04:00">July 29, 1947—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>934. You are authorized to proceed along lines suggested Urtel 1563, July 22
                    (repeated to Shanghai as 636). Believe 6 months from date of issuance of
                    notification (sent Nanking as 934 repeated Shanghai as 1255) would be minimum
                    period acceptable for a deadline.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
